        "accPosId": 1,
        "text_1771909297": {
          "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
          "jcr:createdBy": "kristian.bocage@stryker.com",
          "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "hannah.white@stryker.com",
          "jcr:created": "Tue Sep 17 2024 19:48:31 GMT+0000",
          "text": "<p>Access to healthcare is the foundation of global public health. When health systems are strong, they do more than treat illness. They drive economic stability, foster community wellbeing and provide a critical line of defense against global health threats. Yet, for billions, the path to quality care remains a challenge.<sup>1</sup></p>\n<p>Driven by our mission to make healthcare better, Stryker invests in partnerships that address these gaps. We focus on strengthening the people, equipment and systems required to deliver quality surgical care in the long term. Through our <b><span style=\"color: #1c5687;\"><span style=\"color: #4c7d7a;\">Signature Partner portfolio</span></span></b>, we unite charitable giving and volunteerism to expand surgical training, equip care delivery with donated medical equipment, support the wellbeing of healthcare workers and respond to disasters. By strengthening the foundations of care, we ensure our impact is immediate and enduring.</p>\n<p>Read on to learn how Stryker works with key nonprofit partners to create a better, healthier world.</p>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Thu Feb 26 2026 00:57:19 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
